# Overlays

- Load `config.js` first, then feature modules (`sponsors.js`, `countdown.js`, …).
- Put shared visuals in `assets/theme.css` using `--pgr-*` variables.
- Keep modules small; one concern per file.
- After visual changes: `python tools/generate_showcase.py`.
- Interstitials use `.panel`; live uses `.live-root` transparent chrome.
